# 1️⃣6️⃣ LEARNING RATE

The learning rate controls the step size.

$$
\theta_{new}
=
\theta-\alpha\nabla L
$$

### Too small

```text
Learning rate = 0.000001
```

Training may become extremely slow.

### Too large

```text
Learning rate = 10
```

The model may overshoot the minimum.

```text
      \       /
       \     /
        \   /
         \ /
          ●

Huge step:
   ●             ●
      \       /
```

Potential result:

```text
oscillation
or
divergence
```

