# 2️⃣7️⃣ WHY CONVEXITY MATTERS

A simple convex function looks like:

```text
      \     /
       \   /
        \_/
```

There is one global minimum.

For convex optimization:

```text
Local minimum = Global minimum
```

Linear regression with standard MSE has a convex objective under the usual formulation.

Deep neural networks, however, generally have much more complicated non-convex optimization landscapes.

